    "code": "class Solution:\r\n    def sortEvenOdd(self, nums: List[int]) -> List[int]:\r\n        a = sorted(nums[::2])\r\n        b = sorted(nums[1::2], reverse=True)\r\n        nums[::2] = a\r\n        nums[1::2] = b\r\n        return nums",
